U0xxRmE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"百事可樂將與塔可鐘的飲料協議再延長 11 年"},{"title":"PepsiCo Strikes Back After KFC Loss, Locks In Taco Bell Beverage Deal Through 2036","src":"Benzinga","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"百事可樂在肯德基虧損後反擊，鎖定塔可鐘飲料交易至 2036 年"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":5}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1041061/000104106126000084/yum-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Yum! Brands, Inc. (referred to herein as \"YUM\", the \"Registrant\" or the \"Company\"), was incorporated under the laws of the state of North Carolina in 1997. The principal executive offices of YUM are located at 1441 Gardiner Lane, Louisville, Kentucky 40213, and the telephone number at that location is (502) 874-8300. Our website address is https://www.yum.com.","zh":null},{"en":"YUM, together with its subsidiaries, is referred to in this Form 10-K annual report (\"Form 10-K\") as the Company. The terms \"we,\" \"us\" and \"our\" are also used in the Form 10-K to refer to the Company. Throughout this Form 10-K, the terms \"restaurants,\" \"stores\" and \"units\" are used interchangeably. While YUM does not directly own or operate any restaurants, throughout this document we may refer to restaurants that are owned or operated by our subsidiaries as being Company-owned.","zh":null},{"en":"YUM has over 63,000 restaurants in 155 countries and territories primarily operating under the four concepts of KFC, Taco Bell, Pizza Hut and Habit Burger & Grill (the \"Concepts\"). The Company's KFC, Taco Bell and Pizza Hut brands are global leaders of the chicken, Mexican-inspired food and pizza categories, respectively. Habit Burger & Grill is a fast-casual restaurant concept specializing in made-to-order chargrilled burgers, sandwiches and more. At December 31, 2025, 97% of our Concepts' units are operated by independent franchisees or licensees under the terms of franchise or license agreements. The terms franchise or franchisee within this Form 10-K are meant to describe third parties that operate units under either franchise or license agreements.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The retail food industry, in which our Concepts compete, is made up of supermarkets, supercenters, warehouse stores, convenience stores, coffee shops, snack bars, delicatessens and restaurants (including those in the QSR segment), and is intensely competitive with respect to price and quality of food products, new product development, digital engagement, advertising levels and promotional initiatives, customer service reputation, restaurant location and attractiveness and maintenance of properties. Competition has also increased from and been enabled by delivery aggregators and other food delivery services in recent years, particularly in urbanized areas. Our Concepts also face competition as a result of convergence in grocery, convenience, deli and restaurant services, including the offering by the grocery industry of convenient meals, including pizzas and entrees with side dishes. The ","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"The retail food industry, in which our Concepts compete, is made up of supermarkets, supercenters, warehouse stores, convenience stores, coffee shops, snack bars, delicatessens and restaurants (including those in the QSR segment), and is intensely competitive with respect to price and quality of food products, new product development, digital engagement, advertising levels and promotional initiatives, customer service reputation, restaurant location and attractiveness and maintenance of properties. Competition has also increased from and been enabled by delivery aggregators and other food delivery services in recent years, particularly in urbanized areas. Our Concepts also face competition as a result of convergence in grocery, convenience, deli and restaurant services, including the offering by the grocery industry of convenient meals, including pizzas and entrees with side dishes. The ","zh":null},{"en":"The Company is not aware of any federal, state or local environmental laws or regulations that will materially affect our earnings or competitive position, or result in material capital expenditures. However, the Company cannot predict the effect on our operations due to possible future environmental legislation or regulations. During 2025, there were no material capital expenditures for environmental control facilities and no such material expenditures are anticipated.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Division","val":8220000000,"zh":"Total Division"},{"name":"KFC Global Division","val":3542000000,"zh":"KFC Global Division"},{"name":"Taco Bell Global Division","val":3095000000,"zh":"Taco Bell Global Division"},{"name":"Other","val":2668000000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"Pizza Hut Global Division","val":1013000000,"zh":"Pizza Hut Global Division"},{"name":"The Habit Burger Grill Global Division","val":570000000,"zh":"The Habit Burger Grill Global Division"},{"name":"PH Strategic Options","val":7000000,"zh":"PH Strategic Options"}],"total":8214000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Franchiseandpropertyrevenue","val":3473000000,"zh":"Franchiseandpropertyrevenue"},{"name":"Product","val":2945000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Advertising","val":1796000000,"zh":"Advertising"}],"total":8214000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4525000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"GB","val":1021000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":8214000000}},"peers":["DRI","YUMC","PEP","WEN","DPZ"]}}